                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Mainstream media and the Left continue spreading misinformation about\u00a0Medicaid. This fearmongering and dishonesty are dangerous.\n\u00a0\nLet\u2019s set the record straight - Republicans are strengthening and preserving this important safety net program.\u00a0\ud83e\uddf5",
