                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Americans overwhelmingly believe there should be work requirements for able-bodied adults to receive\u00a0Medicaid\u00a0benefits. Republicans heeded that call.\n\u00a0\nCommonsense work requirements will save $344 BILLION over ten years.",
