                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Hardworking taxpayers have been supporting stay-at-home sons for far too long. Democrats supported this out-of-control spending, which put\u00a0Medicaid\u00a0on an unsustainable path. Republicans are right-sizing\u00a0Medicaid\u00a0to ensure those who truly need support have access now and for generations to come.",
