                "text": "Democrats turned\u00a0Medicaid\u00a0from a safety net into a hammock. It should be protected for our most vulnerable, and under President Trump\u2019s leadership, hardworking taxpayers will no longer foot the bill for able-bodies adults sitting around at home. \u00a0\n\u00a0\nHere\u2019s the bottom line: Republicans are working to save\u00a0Medicaid, so our most vulnerable citizens receive the care they deserve.",
